  "dialogs": [
    {
      "t": 2000,
      "speaker": "May",
      "text": "Eighteen! EIGHTEEN HOLES! Did you see that last ace, Caddy? Straight through the gale, no fear, no mercy!",
      "cps": 20,
      "portrait": "./img/cutscenes/portrait-may.png",
      "portraitSide": "left",
      "duration": 2000
    },
    {
      "t": null,
      "speaker": "Caddy",
      "text": "Saw it, kid. Forty years lugging bags and I never seen anything like it. You made that wind carry you home.",
      "cps": 20,
      "portrait": "./img/cutscenes/portrait-caddy.png",
      "portraitSide": "left",
      "auto": true,
      "duration": 2000
    },
    {
      "t": null,
      "speaker": "Acolyte",
      "text": "She really did it... all eighteen... no one ever has... is this... a new Grandmaster?!",
      "cps": 20,
      "portrait": "./img/cutscenes/portrait-acolyte.png",
      "portraitSide": "left",
      "auto": true,
      "duration": 1500
    },
    {
      "t": null,
      "speaker": "???",
      "text": "Oh, they did it all right. Enjoy the applause while it lasts, heroes. The peak remembers everything.",
      "cps": 20,
      "portrait": "./img/cutscenes/portrait-rat.png",
      "portraitSide": "left",
      "auto": true,
      "duration": 2000
    },
    {
      "t": null,
      "speaker": "Grandmaster Cortex",
      "text": "SILENCE! This is impossible! No one conquers all eighteen! No one shames ME before the Order!",
      "cps": 20,
      "portrait": "./img/cutscenes/portrait-cortex.png",
      "portraitSide": "right",
      "auto": true,
      "duration": 2000
    },
    {
      "t": null,
      "speaker": "Slicer",
      "text": "Outta my way, girlie. What's this? More pocket weather crimes? Hand 'em over, cheaters!",
      "cps": 20,
      "portrait": "./img/cutscenes/portrait-slicer.png",
      "portraitSide": "right",
      "auto": true,
      "duration": 2000
    },
    {
      "t": null,
      "speaker": "May",
      "text": "Hey! Hands off! Do NOT call me a cheater. You want the gadgets, come take the shot yourself!",
      "cps": 20,
      "portrait": "./img/cutscenes/portrait-may.png",
      "portraitSide": "left",
      "auto": true,
      "duration": 2000
    },
    {
      "t": null,
      "speaker": "Slicer",
      "text": "Funny. These look just like... wait. Boss, these are YOURS! Same serials as the lab stash! The underground techlab! Built for your so-called legendary 9-hole run!",
      "cps": 20,
      "portrait": "./img/cutscenes/portrait-slicer.png",
      "portraitSide": "right",
      "auto": true,
      "duration": 2500
    },
    {
      "t": null,
      "speaker": "Ratko",
      "text": "And there it is. The Grandmaster's throne, wobbling at last. Tell them, Cortex. Tell them whose wind you really rode.",
      "cps": 20,
      "portrait": "./img/cutscenes/portrait-rat.png",
      "portraitSide": "left",
      "auto": true,
      "duration": 2000
    },
    {
      "t": null,
      "speaker": "Acolyte",
      "text": "You... you cheated? The sacred nine... was lab tech? We renounce you! You are no Grandmaster of ours!",
      "cps": 20,
      "portrait": "./img/cutscenes/portrait-acolyte.png",
      "portraitSide": "left",
      "auto": true,
      "duration": 2000
    },
    {
      "t": null,
      "speaker": "Grandmaster Cortex",
      "text": "Fools! You dare shun ME? Then gaze upon what the wind truly serves. I am Cortex of Dimension-Y!",
      "cps": 20,
      "portrait": "./img/cutscenes/portrait-cortex.png",
      "portraitSide": "right",
      "auto": true,
      "duration": 2000
    },
    {
      "t": null,
      "speaker": "Grandmaster Cortex",
      "text": "You destroyed my reputation! Now I drag you screaming to my home world! Slicer, girl, bagman... INTO THE PORTAL!",
      "cps": 20,
      "portrait": "./img/cutscenes/portrait-cortex.png",
      "portraitSide": "right",
      "auto": true,
      "duration": 2500
    },
    {
      "t": null,
      "speaker": "Caddy",
      "text": "May, hold on to me! Whatever that thing is, it ain't getting you without going through Caddy Jones first!",
      "cps": 20,
      "portrait": "./img/cutscenes/portrait-caddy.png",
      "portraitSide": "left",
      "auto": true,
      "duration": 2000
    },
    {
      "t": null,
      "speaker": "May",
      "text": "Then we go down swinging! If the gale can carry your voice, it can carry you home! You hear me, demon?",
      "cps": 20,
      "portrait": "./img/cutscenes/portrait-may.png",
      "portraitSide": "left",
      "auto": true,
      "duration": 2000
    },
    {
      "t": null,
      "speaker": "Ratko",
      "text": "Heh. Told you the peak remembers. Pleasant trip, everyone. Give my regards to Dimension-Y.",
      "cps": 20,
      "portrait": "./img/cutscenes/portrait-rat.png",
      "portraitSide": "left",
      "auto": true,
      "duration": 2000
    },
    {
      "t": null,
      "speaker": "Acolyte",
      "text": "They're... gone. May... Caddy... the Slicer... the fraud... all swallowed by the storm...",
      "cps": 20,
      "portrait": "./img/cutscenes/portrait-acolyte.png",
      "portraitSide": "left",
      "auto": true,
      "duration": 2000
    }
  ],
